---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Pages use Markdown in `src/content/pages/`, rendered through `src/pages/[...page].astro`.
- Content schemas live in `src/lib/schemas.ts`.
- Use the existing `src/components/ui/image` component for optimized images.
- Tailwind CSS 4 runs through `@tailwindcss/vite` in `astro.config.ts`.
- Theme variables belong in `src/styles/global.css`, which uses `@theme inline`.
- Never use `@apply`.
